rill and excitement of \u201cNinja Warrior\u201d come alive in VR!\nUse every bit of your strength, balance, and reflexes to conquer intense obstacle courses through full-body motion."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u6a2a\u9577\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_2560\u00d71440px.png", "id": "4206557512967114", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619098_4206557516300447_943281957663249977_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-nUUvN3n-J8Q7kNvwHD21TP&_nc_oc=Adra1sNACi-XdPG4o0SuU93jtx43W15VbvvUWYsLg_OEfO22oBH3bJRQJnBO27tLtOU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTUFZ00_BpjVXBV5ZXCeDDulaavlU229wL7BRa11-q8Zw&oe=6AFC6CAF"}, {"file_name": "\u30d2\u30fc\u30ed\u30fc\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_3000\u00d7900px.png", "id": "2975615619303809", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619774_2975615622637142_1331376706207959328_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZrkFt9NubZsQ7kNvwHt7o5m&_nc_oc=AdrR3Y9k3iVxgeTNR3GFsK1JwJlXwLPxx-lVMtMfDopZYFJzYFbj99RqWdlq5BqmaiY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTG3H6bEZFurU3NXutlNuWP6gQLR6OR4C9dNe2vud4ScQ&oe=6AFC7E9A"}, {"file_name": "\u7e26\u9577\u306e\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_1008\u00d71440px.png", "id": "1459347908497843", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_1459347911831176_5240984296618367253_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nAbz4HGueOwQ7kNvwEfgOFu&_nc_oc=Adq6TNSLU-4BRF8UDbNwm8ruyCkcggmDd6OGilwL2P7HFvYO3baqhHNzEbYe9z7S0ps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQYA_9bd0UzRqr4LwW_bV_zsetSeP5pcFg738Zxa3IyYw&oe=6AFC63BC"}, {"file_name": "\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3_512\u00d7512px.png", "id": "1182588407080721", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scon